# The orig-<component> tarballs are upstream release tarballs and tag
# archives, used unmodified and pinned by SHA-256 in stack/components.tsv.
# Their test data, documentation and bundled third-party trees (for example
# Hyprland's tracy submodule and CMake's test suite) are not rebuilt from
# source because nothing from them is built or shipped.
source-is-missing
source-contains-prebuilt-binary
source-contains-prebuilt-windows-binary
source-contains-prebuilt-javascript-object
source-contains-prebuilt-wasm-binary
source-contains-prebuilt-java-object
source-contains-prebuilt-ms-help-file
source-contains-prebuilt-doxygen-documentation
source-contains-prebuilt-sphinx-documentation
very-long-line-length-in-source-file
# CMake (built only for noble) ships CMakeCache.txt files as test fixtures.
source-contains-cmake-cache-file [cmake/Tests/*]
